格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"dsh plugin: run work as a small crew of role agents (product manager, researcher, architect, engineer, QA, code reviewer, security reviewer, doc reviewer) that share work through files on disk","id":"gh:1337801265","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-crew","slug":"stuarthu/dsh-crew","topics":["ai-agent","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","multi-agent"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"dsh plugin: run work as a small crew of role agents (product manager, researcher, architect, enginee"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"r, QA, code reviewer, security reviewer, doc reviewer) that share work through files on disk"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-crew"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> **Version 0.13.0.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"dsh-crew is a plugin for DeepSeek Harness (dsh). It turns your dsh session into a\nproduct manager (P"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"M) that runs a crew of role agents: architect, engineer, test\nengineer, code engineer, QA, code revi"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ewer, security reviewer, doc reviewer, and\nresearcher."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## What it is"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"You talk to the PM. The PM starts role agents for the work. A job's documents go in a\nfolder outside"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" your project, so your project folder stays clean. They are read while the\njob runs and are not kept"},{"id":"p6s3","text":" after it. The files that do stay in your project are the five\nthat ship: the two READMEs, `CHANGELO"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"G.md`, `CLAUDE.md` and `principles.md`."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Two lanes:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- `ask` — you want an answer. The PM answers. Nothing changes.\n- `team` — you want a change. The PM "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"runs the crew: one task per change, one round\nof QA, one round of each review, then a commit. Pushin"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"g and publishing still need\nyour own yes, every time."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Restart dsh. Pick the **Crew** preset for a session."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"1. Install the plugin (above).\n2. Restart dsh.\n3. Start a session on the **Crew** preset. Your sessi"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"on becomes the PM.\n4. Ask a question, or ask for a change."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Everything is optional. Settings live in two places:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- The `dsh-crew-core` and `dsh-crew-git-guard` rows in your profile's\n`cordis.patch.yml`: roles fold"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"er, live-agent limit, review rounds, job folder,\nand the git guard.\n- The `dsh-crew-roles` row: per-"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"role tools and models. Which file holds it\ndepends on your dsh. On dsh 0.1.x it is the plugin's copy"},{"id":"p16s4","text":" of the preset at\n`~/.dsh/.agent-presets/crew/agent.cordis.yml`. On dsh 0.2.x — which reads\npreset r"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"ows and never that folder — it is the `preset-crew` row in the\nplugin's own `cordis.patch.yml`, and "},{"id":"p16s6","text":"your profile's `cordis.patch.yml` can\noverride it by that row id. Set a role filter in the file your"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"e's `cordis.patch.yml` can\noverride it by that row id. Set a role filter in the file your dsh reads."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
